id: pm-slack-standup-hound-generated-dist
title: Stop Hound from linting generated dist/ output
description: "Disable Hound JSHint using the pm-slack and pm-web precedent: committed dist/ JavaScript targets ES2022, while Hound defaults to ES5 and produces false positives."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[2]: ci,review-bots
created_at: "2026-10-27T08:02:39.165Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T10:38:59.159Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-27T10:38:53.031Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-27T08:28:26.000Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Hound no longer lints generated dist/ output; no other lint or gate changes
resolution: Disable the incompatible Hound JSHint integration while preserving package lint and release checks.
expected_result: Hound configuration disables JSHint on generated output without changing other lint or release gates.
actual_result: The focused configuration assertion passes on current main. The implementation diff contains only .hound.yml and tracker records; prior npm/Bun release-gate receipts remain in the merged PR.
