  "2026-10-27T08:02:49.407Z",codex-agent,"Configuration revert proof: the focused Node assertion passes with .hound.yml present, fails when the new file is removed, then passes after restoring its exact bytes. No source behavior or package gates change."
  "2026-10-27T08:21:00.132Z",codex-agent,"Validation complete: focused configuration assertion and both unchanged release:check gates passed under isolated Git identity with at most two test workers. Changelog regenerated from fetched tags; final changelog:check follows all tracker writes. No lint, gate, source, dependency or generated dist changes. Hound service behavior will be observable on the PR; no merge authorized. Measured test counts: npm: 287 tests, 287 passed, 0 skipped; gate exit 0; bun: 287 tests, 287 passed, 0 skipped; gate exit 0."
  "2026-10-27T10:33:58.158Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: Inspected .hound.yml on main: Hound JSHint is explicitly disabled for committed generated ES2022 output. The merged implementation changes only this Hound configuration plus its tracker evidence; package lint, release gates, dependencies and dist remain unchanged. This proves both acceptance criteria at the repository configuration boundary; external Hound service availability is not asserted. Delivered by PR #159, merge commit 558dcac7a4eb8bf441b4e7175bed0d77dd846a04, merged_at 2026-10-27T08:28:26Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T10:38:19.788Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: Inspected .hound.yml on main: Hound JSHint is explicitly disabled for committed generated ES2022 output. The merged implementation changes only this Hound configuration plus its tracker evidence; package lint, release gates, dependencies and dist remain unchanged. This proves both acceptance criteria at the repository configuration boundary; external Hound service availability is not asserted. Delivered by PR #159, merge commit 558dcac7a4eb8bf441b4e7175bed0d77dd846a04, merged_at 2026-10-27T08:28:26Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
  "2026-10-27T10:38:48.293Z",codex-agent,"Verified current main with `node -e \"require('node:assert/strict').match(require('node:fs').readFileSync('.hound.yml','utf8'), /^jshint:\\n  enabled: false\\s*$/m)\"` via the pinned pm linked runner: PASS. The focused command exited successfully. The focused configuration assertion passes on current main. The implementation diff contains only .hound.yml and tracker records; prior npm/Bun release-gate receipts remain in the merged PR."
